    ' -implementer-brief.md, docs/j-b-scoping-ruling-2026-08-02.md,
    ' docs/weekday-scope-ruling-2026-08-03.md.
    '
    ' A49a-j are the proposal's own §6 arms; A49k/A49l are the two the rulings add
